# Tailscale Funnel / LAN TLS certs at repo root — NEVER commit (especially the private .key)
/admins-mac-studio-2.tailb723c1.ts.net.crt
/admins-mac-studio-2.tailb723c1.ts.net.key
*.tailb723c1.ts.net.key
*.tailb723c1.ts.net.crt

